.TH "RAIL0" "1" "Jul 2026" "rail0 CLI" ""

.SH NAME
rail0-webhooks - Webhook subscription management (requires login)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrail0 webhooks [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage webhook subscriptions for the authenticated account.

.PP
A webhook subscribes to exactly one payment-lifecycle topic (e.g.
payments.captured) and delivers a signed callback to your endpoint. The
shared secret used to verify delivery signatures is returned only once, on
create and rotate-secret.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for webhooks


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--base-url\fP=""
	RAIL0 gateway base URL (env: RAIL0_BASE_URL)

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	Print HTTP request/response details to stderr

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Force plain (uncolored) JSON output (useful in scripts)

.PP
\fB--pretty\fP[=false]
	Use the key-value/table view instead of JSON (terminal only)

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	Print only the result's id/hash, one per line (useful in scripts)


